What's new in this Version:

* Add Selkies webcam interposer to all base images for camera passthrough
* Build the proot binary from the linuxserver fork based on the Termux patches, raise the builder to Focal with a kernel 3.2 minimum
* Publish a prerelease build on every real commit to master for downstream ingestion
* Drop the net coop flag when running apps
* New apps: Azahar, Cemu, ChatGPT, Claude Desktop, DOSBox Staging, DuckStation, Eden, Google Antigravity, LM Studio, MAME, OpenCode, PCSX2, RPCS3, ScummVM, xemu, Xenia Edge
* Rebase PPSSPP to Resolute
* Fix Firefox failing to launch by using sh and bypassing the Mozilla debug wrapper
